WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.120
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.390 --> 01:34.930
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.330 --> 01:37.670
[Episode 52]

4
01:38.430 --> 01:40.120
In my opinion,

5
01:38.570 --> 01:40.220
[Nanjing, Jiangsu]

6
01:40.160 --> 01:42.400
unless the Chinese government

7
01:42.840 --> 01:44.070
takes swift action

8
01:44.090 --> 01:46.979
in response to the situation in North China,

9
01:47.280 --> 01:48.360
the crisis there

10
01:48.360 --> 01:51.229
will only worsen.

11
01:51.229 --> 01:53.110
We still insist on one principle:

12
01:53.720 --> 01:56.880
if any problems arise between China and Japan,

13
01:57.000 --> 01:59.950
the Japanese side must negotiate with the Nationalist Government,

14
01:59.950 --> 02:02.440
rather than with local authorities.

15
02:02.640 --> 02:06.300
Local authorities cannot speak for the Nationalist government.

16
02:06.470 --> 02:07.520
We have noticed

17
02:08.039 --> 02:10.780
that you have concentrated part of the Central Army

18
02:10.780 --> 02:13.540
in Shandong and southern Henan.

19
02:13.680 --> 02:15.720
Does Generalissimo Chiang mean

20
02:15.850 --> 02:17.440
to use force

21
02:16.600 --> 02:19.420
[Akiyoshi Arikichi, Japanese Ambassador to China]

22
02:17.470 --> 02:21.400
to resolve the situation in North China?

23
02:24.360 --> 02:25.770
[Yang Yongtai, Secretary-General of the Wuchang Field Headquarters]

24
02:25.790 --> 02:27.730
[Qian Dajun, Director of the First Department, Chairman's Office, Military Affairs Commission of the Nationalist Government]

25
02:37.910 --> 02:39.280
Ambassador,

26
02:39.590 --> 02:41.570
I'm afraid you've misunderstood me.

27
02:41.570 --> 02:44.079
Let me put it another way.

28
02:44.350 --> 02:45.510
If the Japanese side

29
02:46.000 --> 02:47.440
can take effective measures

30
02:47.440 --> 02:49.790
to curb the North China Autonomy Movement,

31
02:49.790 --> 02:51.160
then in return,

32
02:51.280 --> 02:54.540
the Nationalist government would be willing to negotiate

33
02:54.560 --> 02:57.000
with Mr. Hirota on his Three Principles

34
02:57.840 --> 02:59.280
regarding North China.

35
03:03.960 --> 03:05.960
We very much welcome your government's

36
03:05.960 --> 03:08.930
positive attitude towards Hirota's Three Principles.

37
03:08.930 --> 03:10.530
But I would like to remind you

38
03:10.610 --> 03:13.890
that the question of autonomy in North China

39
03:14.030 --> 03:17.280
is separate from Hirota's Three Principles.

40
03:17.790 --> 03:20.190
I hope the Nanjing government can change

41
03:20.190 --> 03:22.960
its understanding of the North China Autonomy Movement.

42
03:22.960 --> 03:24.960
To use a Chinese idiom,

43
03:25.350 --> 03:30.160
North China's autonomy is the general trend.

44
03:30.160 --> 03:32.310
I hope you understand.

45
03:37.790 --> 03:41.160
I'll take my leave now.

46
04:17.360 --> 04:18.829
I know.

47
04:19.560 --> 04:20.510
Generalissimo.

48
04:21.000 --> 04:22.150
Regarding North China,

49
04:22.150 --> 04:24.270
if the Nationalist Government overreacts,

50
04:24.270 --> 04:26.880
once Song Zheyuan agrees to North China's autonomy,

51
04:26.880 --> 04:28.880
then years of enduring humiliation

52
04:29.120 --> 04:30.880
will be for nothing.

53
04:31.040 --> 04:32.770
Humiliated by foreign powers,

54
04:33.690 --> 04:34.920
burdened at home,

55
04:36.000 --> 04:37.780
and wronged at every turn.

56
04:41.360 --> 04:43.650
Is this God's test for me?

57
04:46.070 --> 04:47.920
Tolerating the Japanese

58
04:48.150 --> 04:49.940
is to buy time.

59
04:51.360 --> 04:53.159
But towards the Communist Army,

60
04:53.360 --> 04:56.600
we cannot tolerate them for another moment.

61
04:56.920 --> 04:58.240
Send a telegram to Zhang Hanqing (Zhang Xueliang).

62
04:58.240 --> 05:00.440
Tell him in my name

63
05:00.800 --> 05:03.950
to step up preparations for the campaign against the Communists.

64
05:03.950 --> 05:05.440
Immediately!

65
05:06.480 --> 05:08.360
Zhang Xueliang just sent a telegram.

66
05:08.360 --> 05:09.000
Speak.

67
05:09.150 --> 05:10.480
He asked for your approval

68
05:10.480 --> 05:11.710
to order the Ministry of War

69
05:11.710 --> 05:14.000
to grant 100,000 silver dollars in compensation

70
05:14.000 --> 05:17.240
to each of the two division commanders, He Lizhong and Niu Yuanfeng,

71
05:17.240 --> 05:20.440
who were killed in the battles of Laoshan and Zhiluozhen.

72
05:21.040 --> 05:23.390
In addition, he also requested to replenish

73
05:23.390 --> 05:26.240
the troops and weapons of the 109th Division.

74
05:26.330 --> 05:28.800
He is taking this opportunity to vent his dissatisfaction.

75
05:28.800 --> 05:30.260
He wants a pension, right?

76
05:30.270 --> 05:32.400
Tell him to go to the local government.

77
05:33.040 --> 05:33.800
Understood.

78
05:34.070 --> 05:35.390
What about the troops and weapons?

79
05:35.390 --> 05:36.270
Tell Zhang Hanqing

80
05:36.270 --> 05:38.480
not to make me disband this division.

81
05:38.870 --> 05:40.350
I don't need to keep so many

82
05:40.380 --> 05:42.240
Northeastern Army troops who refuse to fight the Communists.

83
05:42.240 --> 05:42.920
Yes, sir.

84
05:50.630 --> 05:51.770
This sofa!

85
05:52.360 --> 05:53.630
Throw it away!

86
05:54.120 --> 05:54.860
It's dirty!

87
05:57.390 --> 05:59.620
On November 20

88
05:59.750 --> 06:00.920
and 22, 1935,

89
06:01.440 --> 06:04.500
Chiang Kai-shek met with Akira Ariyoshi twice in a row,

90
06:04.800 --> 06:06.860
expressing his stance on Hirota's Three Principles

91
06:06.860 --> 06:08.710
and the autonomy of North China,

92
06:09.270 --> 06:11.330
compromising with Japan once again.

93
06:12.310 --> 06:13.230
Chunrong.

94
06:13.800 --> 06:15.120
I've been shot twice.

95
06:15.290 --> 06:18.120
This letter might be my last words.

96
06:18.880 --> 06:20.280
Fighting our own people,

97
06:20.750 --> 06:22.190
I feel so aggrieved.

98
06:22.090 --> 06:25.990
[Wang Yizhe, Commander of the 67th Army of the Northeastern Army]

99
06:22.710 --> 06:25.190
Every bullet fired carries guilt.

100
06:25.880 --> 06:28.210
Our hometown is occupied by the Japanese,

101
06:28.600 --> 06:30.860
and our fellow villagers are suffering.

102
06:30.920 --> 06:32.920
Yet we are fighting a civil war here.

103
06:33.440 --> 06:35.880
I can only watch helplessly as our land

104
06:35.900 --> 06:38.560
and our home fall into the hands of the enemy.

105
06:39.510 --> 06:40.790
My heart aches so much

106
06:41.480 --> 06:43.080
that I can't even cry.

107
06:43.110 --> 06:46.980
[Zhang Xueliang, Acting Commander-in-Chief of the Kuomintang Northwest "Communist Bandit Suppression" Headquarters]

108
06:43.720 --> 06:45.710
You've been married to me for ten years,

109
06:45.710 --> 06:47.710
and our family has always been poor.

110
06:47.920 --> 06:50.580
We've been surviving on my meager military pay.

111
06:50.920 --> 06:52.360
After I'm gone,

112
06:53.000 --> 06:55.310
your life will probably be even harder.

113
06:55.510 --> 06:57.270
Our mother is blind,

114
06:57.630 --> 06:59.159
and our child is only three.

115
06:59.830 --> 07:01.440
When I think of your frail shoulders

116
07:01.440 --> 07:02.770
having to carry so much,

117
07:03.070 --> 07:05.800
my chest feels like it's being twisted by a knife.

118
07:05.950 --> 07:07.830
I owe you too much in this life,

119
07:08.480 --> 07:09.950
and I can't pay it back.

120
07:10.950 --> 07:12.040
Chunrong.

121
07:12.040 --> 07:13.370
When our child grows up,

122
07:13.800 --> 07:16.360
if he asks how I died,

123
07:16.830 --> 07:18.390
please don't tell him

124
07:18.830 --> 07:20.630
that I died fighting a civil war.

125
07:21.240 --> 07:22.270
As a soldier,

126
07:22.600 --> 07:24.400
I couldn't drive away the enemy.

127
07:24.830 --> 07:25.680
As a son,

128
07:26.070 --> 07:28.130
I couldn't fulfill my filial duties.

129
07:28.440 --> 07:29.310
As a husband,

130
07:29.560 --> 07:31.120
I couldn't protect my wife.

131
07:31.800 --> 07:32.750
As a father,

132
07:32.950 --> 07:34.630
I couldn't raise my child.

133
07:34.880 --> 07:37.070
I've already lost so much face.

134
07:37.880 --> 07:39.340
Just in front of our child,

135
07:39.480 --> 07:40.909
leave me this tiny bit

136
07:41.270 --> 07:42.820
of pitiful dignity.

137
07:44.070 --> 07:45.140
Chunrong.

138
07:46.510 --> 07:47.880
Writing up to here,

139
07:48.510 --> 07:49.710
I look up

140
07:50.880 --> 07:53.210
and see a crescent moon hanging in the sky.

141
07:53.750 --> 07:55.070
Thousands of miles away,

142
07:55.070 --> 07:56.830
you can see it too, right?

143
07:57.920 --> 08:00.630
This crescent moon shines on our home.

144
08:01.440 --> 08:02.970
But our mother can't see it,

145
08:03.830 --> 08:06.330
so you'll have to describe it to her.

146
08:07.150 --> 08:08.680
I can't write another word.

147
08:08.920 --> 08:10.120
My heart is bleeding.

148
08:11.510 --> 08:12.710
My heart is bleeding.

149
08:17.150 --> 08:18.480
Dingfang (Wang Yizhe),

150
08:18.680 --> 08:20.260
I've paid their pensions.

151
08:24.680 --> 08:27.390
You can afford compensation

152
08:27.570 --> 08:30.140
for one man, ten men,

153
08:30.310 --> 08:32.200
even a hundred.

154
08:32.480 --> 08:34.120
You can pay off the families

155
08:34.480 --> 08:36.030
causing trouble, too.

156
08:36.120 --> 08:38.480
But can you compensate the more than 100,000 soldiers

157
08:38.480 --> 08:39.940
of the Northeastern Army?

158
08:40.039 --> 08:42.270
What about the 30 million people back home in the Northeast?

159
08:42.270 --> 08:43.600
Can you afford it?

160
08:43.630 --> 08:44.720
Can you?

161
08:44.910 --> 08:46.150
I can't afford it.

162
08:46.200 --> 08:48.730
I can't afford it. I can't afford it.

163
08:55.630 --> 08:57.550
I can't afford it.

164
08:58.520 --> 08:59.820
I can't afford it.

165
09:03.010 --> 09:04.490
On my uniform,

166
09:05.960 --> 09:08.080
I wear three stars.

167
09:08.360 --> 09:10.000
I am a general.

168
09:11.720 --> 09:14.750
I am the acting commander-in-chief of the Northwest Suppression Headquarters.

169
09:14.750 --> 09:16.880
In front of you, I am a human being.

170
09:16.950 --> 09:18.520
But when I turn my back,

171
09:18.790 --> 09:22.200
how many people would curse me,

172
09:22.430 --> 09:24.050
calling me a traitor to my country,

173
09:24.050 --> 09:25.780
a collaborator with the enemy?

174
09:26.390 --> 09:28.480
How many of our 400 million countrymen

175
09:28.480 --> 09:31.150
want to curse me?

176
09:31.600 --> 09:33.110
But I can't cry.

177
09:34.710 --> 09:36.170
I don't dare to cry either.

178
09:37.910 --> 09:39.790
Because I am a man.

179
09:40.910 --> 09:42.600
Do you know what my biggest wish is

180
09:42.600 --> 09:44.200
right now?

181
09:47.950 --> 09:49.470
I wish the sun

182
09:49.670 --> 09:52.000
would set a little earlier.

183
09:52.360 --> 09:54.000
I wish the moon

184
09:54.150 --> 09:56.080
would rise a little faster.

185
09:56.200 --> 09:58.910
I wish the sky would always be dark.

186
09:59.510 --> 10:02.360
Because I feel most at ease in the dark.

187
10:03.200 --> 10:04.630
Everyone is asleep.

188
10:05.080 --> 10:07.200
No one is cursing me anymore.

189
10:10.150 --> 10:11.550
I can cry.

190
10:18.790 --> 10:19.840
When dawn breaks,

191
10:20.880 --> 10:22.970
400 million compatriots wake up.

192
10:24.080 --> 10:25.750
I don't know how many people

193
10:26.120 --> 10:32.200
are still calling me, Zhang Xueliang, a traitor,

194
10:33.960 --> 10:35.960
and a sellout.

195
10:41.080 --> 10:42.120
Hanqing.

196
10:42.550 --> 10:43.790
You've cried,

197
10:44.150 --> 10:45.630
and you've vented.

198
10:46.480 --> 10:48.910
You can draw the curtains in this room,

199
10:49.270 --> 10:51.880
but are you going to live in the dark forever?

200
10:52.630 --> 10:55.030
Are you never going to step out of this room?

201
10:55.210 --> 10:57.340
You have to go out and see the sunlight.

202
10:57.430 --> 10:58.870
You have to change!

203
11:00.000 --> 11:00.910
Hanqing!

204
11:02.270 --> 11:03.180
Hanqing!

205
11:29.150 --> 11:30.330
You are right.

206
11:32.510 --> 11:33.510
We must change.

207
11:50.030 --> 11:52.270
This is a letter jointly written to me

208
11:52.380 --> 11:53.880
by Gao Chongmin and Lu Guangji

209
11:53.880 --> 11:55.360
of the Northeastern People's Anti-Japanese National Salvation Association.

210
11:55.360 --> 11:58.880
They propose that our Northeastern Army, Yang Hucheng,

211
11:58.910 --> 12:00.390
Sheng Shicai in Xinjiang,

212
12:00.410 --> 12:01.680
and the Red Army

213
12:02.280 --> 12:04.280
unite to resist Japan.

214
12:05.840 --> 12:07.720
What do you think?

215
12:07.750 --> 12:09.790
Uniting with the Northwestern Army

216
12:09.940 --> 12:12.340
and Sheng Shicai in Xinjiang is easy.

217
12:12.730 --> 12:14.840
But as for the Red Army of the Communist Party,

218
12:14.840 --> 12:15.720
I'm not sure.

219
12:15.970 --> 12:17.570
Then what do you plan to do?

220
12:17.880 --> 12:19.260
They mentioned in the letter

221
12:19.260 --> 12:21.460
that this idea wasn't proposed by them,

222
12:21.880 --> 12:23.750
but by Du Zhongyuan in Shanghai.

223
12:23.980 --> 12:26.290
I've known him for years.

224
12:26.600 --> 12:28.260
He's a fellow Northeasterner

225
12:28.390 --> 12:30.150
and has always supported the anti-Japanese resistance.

226
12:30.150 --> 12:31.410
I've heard of this man.

227
12:31.670 --> 12:33.120
Two years ago, he mocked the Japanese emperor

228
12:33.120 --> 12:34.570
in a magazine he was publishing.

229
12:34.570 --> 12:36.720
The Japanese pressured the Nationalist government,

230
12:36.720 --> 12:38.450
which sentenced him to prison.

231
12:39.960 --> 12:41.820
When I go to the meeting this time,

232
12:42.080 --> 12:44.160
I'll find a way to meet him.

233
12:44.600 --> 12:47.730
If he can propose the idea of a great Northwest alliance,

234
12:48.360 --> 12:50.240
he must have profound insights.

235
12:50.510 --> 12:52.110
It's good for you to meet him.

236
12:52.270 --> 12:54.530
Listening to his views is not a bad thing.

237
12:55.320 --> 12:57.000
Also, I heard

238
12:57.790 --> 12:59.240
that Li Du, the former commander of the Independent 24th Brigade

239
12:59.240 --> 13:01.480
of our Northeastern Army,

240
13:01.720 --> 13:03.360
has also returned from the Soviet Union.

241
13:03.360 --> 13:04.790
He is in Shanghai.

242
13:05.030 --> 13:06.120
As far as I know,

243
13:06.320 --> 13:09.120
he might have some connections with the Communist Party.

244
13:09.120 --> 13:10.390
When you go to Shanghai this time,

245
13:10.390 --> 13:12.790
it's best to find a way to meet him too.

246
13:12.910 --> 13:13.880
Okay.

247
13:15.090 --> 13:16.030
Operations room.

248
13:16.030 --> 13:16.270
Okay.

249
13:16.270 --> 13:17.470
Everyone, assemble.

250
13:22.510 --> 13:26.420
[Temporary Garrison of the 4th Front Army, Renjiaba, Sichuan]

251
13:26.160 --> 13:26.800
Here,

252
13:26.840 --> 13:27.480
and here.

253
13:32.910 --> 13:33.880
Chairman Zhang,

254
13:34.430 --> 13:35.910
we don't have enough food.

255
13:36.120 --> 13:38.460
Should we expand the collection area?

256
13:41.600 --> 13:42.880
What the hell are you doing?

257
13:42.880 --> 13:45.880
Do you really need to ask me about something like this?

258
13:46.270 --> 13:47.270
Understood.

259
13:59.960 --> 14:03.220
[Li Te, Deputy Chief of Staff of the 4th Front Army]

260
14:02.670 --> 14:03.600
Chairman Zhang.

261
14:08.750 --> 14:09.430
Speak.

262
14:10.200 --> 14:11.800
What bad news is it this time?

263
14:21.320 --> 14:23.510
It's Mao Zedong and Peng Dehuai.

264
14:23.790 --> 14:26.720
They sent a telegram in the name of the 1st Front Army,

265
14:27.010 --> 14:30.240
informing us of the victory at Zhiluo Town.

266
14:52.200 --> 14:53.600
Is this a victory report?

267
14:54.580 --> 14:56.270
This is an insult to me!

268
15:00.430 --> 15:01.200
Yes.

269
15:02.070 --> 15:04.340
We lost at Baizhangguan,

270
15:04.860 --> 15:07.320
and didn't settle everything in one battle.

271
15:07.390 --> 15:08.120
They won,

272
15:08.120 --> 15:09.360
but so what?

273
15:09.630 --> 15:12.090
Does one battle decide everything for them?

274
15:12.320 --> 15:13.000
Besides,

275
15:13.000 --> 15:14.660
we still have over 40,000 men.

276
15:14.960 --> 15:16.480
How many do they have left?

277
15:17.360 --> 15:18.790
I think they might not be able to

278
15:18.790 --> 15:20.850
gain a foothold in northern Shaanxi.

279
15:26.240 --> 15:28.480
Just because they won one battle,

280
15:28.550 --> 15:32.950
they think they can pull rank and lecture me on behalf of the Central Committee?

281
15:35.320 --> 15:36.430
Tell the Confidential Bureau

282
15:36.430 --> 15:38.840
not to convey the content of the telegram to anyone else.

283
15:38.840 --> 15:39.510
Yes.

284
15:40.880 --> 15:41.900
Should we reply?

285
15:52.360 --> 15:53.000
Yes.

286
15:53.270 --> 15:54.790
Why not?

287
15:56.910 --> 15:58.240
The Central Committee.

288
16:00.670 --> 16:03.390
It seems I was too hesitant before.

289
16:04.030 --> 16:05.720
Now that we've come to this point,

290
16:05.720 --> 16:08.120
let's just put our cards on the table.

291
16:08.480 --> 16:11.570
In the name of the Party and Youth League Central Committee,

292
16:11.570 --> 16:12.540
reply to them.

293
16:16.440 --> 16:17.200
Chairman Zhang,

294
16:17.200 --> 16:18.730
should we send it publicly?

295
16:19.550 --> 16:20.540
Of course.

296
16:21.120 --> 16:22.600
Completely public.

297
16:22.880 --> 16:24.080
What are we afraid of?

298
16:28.000 --> 16:29.660
The more critical the moment,

299
16:34.910 --> 16:36.570
the less we can show weakness.

300
16:41.530 --> 16:45.930
[Dongcun, Fuxian County, Shaanxi]

301
16:56.240 --> 16:57.200
Mao.

302
16:59.430 --> 17:01.200
Who are you writing to?

303
17:02.790 --> 17:05.190
This one is for Deng Baoshan,

304
17:05.190 --> 17:06.849
Commander of the newly formed

305
17:08.230 --> 17:09.400
1st Army.

306
17:10.839 --> 17:12.440
This one is for Yang Hucheng,

307
17:13.359 --> 17:15.470
Director of the Xi'an Pacification Headquarters

308
17:15.470 --> 17:18.119
and Commander-in-Chief of the 17th Route Army.

309
17:18.119 --> 17:18.910
And this one

310
17:19.079 --> 17:20.410
is for his subordinate,

311
17:20.430 --> 17:22.800
Chief Adviser Du Bincheng.

312
17:23.040 --> 17:23.950
Mao,

313
17:24.520 --> 17:27.079
you are using your pen as a gun

314
17:27.319 --> 17:29.450
to subdue the enemy without fighting.

315
17:29.880 --> 17:30.710
No.

316
17:31.390 --> 17:32.920
I'm using letters as envoys

317
17:33.710 --> 17:36.040
to urge them to stop the civil war

318
17:36.360 --> 17:38.280
and unite with us to resist Japan.

319
17:38.470 --> 17:40.000
These letters are eloquent

320
17:40.710 --> 17:41.950
and powerful,

321
17:43.280 --> 17:44.610
and above all, sincere.

322
17:45.150 --> 17:47.080
With praise from you, General Peng,

323
17:47.080 --> 17:48.560
I guess they're not bad.

324
17:49.280 --> 17:51.050
I'm just telling the truth.

325
17:53.760 --> 17:55.800
Help me put these letters into envelopes.

326
17:55.800 --> 17:56.730
Comrade Zedong,

327
17:57.120 --> 17:58.430
Zhang Guotao sent a telegram.

328
17:58.430 --> 18:01.090
He has established another Central Committee.

329
18:03.320 --> 18:05.040
To Comrades Peng, Mao, and others.

330
18:05.040 --> 18:05.720
A.

331
18:06.600 --> 18:08.600
We have already used the names of the CPC Central Committee,

332
18:08.600 --> 18:10.600
the Central Committee of the Communist Youth League, the Central Government,

333
18:10.600 --> 18:13.390
the Central Revolutionary Military Commission, and the General Headquarters

334
18:13.390 --> 18:15.230
to publish documents externally

335
18:15.230 --> 18:17.120
and enter into dealings with you.

336
18:17.800 --> 18:18.560
B.

337
18:19.230 --> 18:21.360
You should act as the Northern Bureau of the Party,

338
18:21.360 --> 18:23.600
the Shaanxi and Gansu Government, and the Northern Route Army.

339
18:23.600 --> 18:26.560
You must not falsely use the name of the CPC Central Committee anymore.

340
18:26.560 --> 18:27.150
C.

341
18:27.600 --> 18:31.120
The names of the 1st and 4th Front Armies are hereby abolished.

342
18:31.390 --> 18:32.120
D.

343
18:32.430 --> 18:34.710
You should report the organizational status of the Northern Bureau,

344
18:34.710 --> 18:37.230
the Northern Route Army, and the political power

345
18:37.230 --> 18:38.280
for approval.

346
18:38.950 --> 18:41.350
Party and Youth League Central Committee.

347
18:43.470 --> 18:44.910
After all this,

348
18:45.360 --> 18:48.150
he's finally shown his true colors.

349
18:48.280 --> 18:50.990
I thought he'd turn back once he hit a wall.

350
18:51.190 --> 18:52.520
Who knew hitting that wall

351
18:52.520 --> 18:54.580
would only make him more determined?

352
18:54.600 --> 18:55.560
Is Zhang Guotao

353
18:55.670 --> 18:57.630
even a Communist anymore?

354
19:01.560 --> 19:02.990
Does Luofu and Zhang Hao

355
19:03.230 --> 19:04.470
know about this?

356
19:05.130 --> 19:08.020
The telegram was forwarded by the Corps cadres.

357
19:08.080 --> 19:09.470
They probably don't know about it.

358
19:09.470 --> 19:10.990
Send a telegram to Luofu immediately.

359
19:10.990 --> 19:11.800
Tell him

360
19:12.280 --> 19:14.150
we are returning to Wayaobu today.

361
19:14.150 --> 19:15.390
Many important matters

362
19:15.390 --> 19:16.800
need to be decided as soon as possible.

363
19:16.800 --> 19:17.430
Yes.

364
19:21.670 --> 19:24.540
[Nanjing, Jiangsu]

365
19:25.080 --> 19:26.360
Director Yan, please.

366
19:26.430 --> 19:27.190
Okay.

367
19:29.080 --> 19:29.910
Director Yan.

368
19:30.360 --> 19:31.040
Please wait a moment.

369
19:31.040 --> 19:32.120
I will go and inform the Generalissimo.

370
19:32.120 --> 19:32.880
Thank you.

371
20:08.390 --> 20:09.280
Brother.

372
20:08.680 --> 20:11.470
[Yan Xishan, Director of the Taiyuan Pacification Headquarters of the Nationalist Government]

373
20:10.320 --> 20:11.250
Generalissimo.

374
20:13.670 --> 20:14.630
Brother.

375
20:15.230 --> 20:17.630
I invited you all the way from Shanxi.

376
20:18.080 --> 20:19.710
It must have been a tiring journey.

377
20:19.710 --> 20:21.150
Not at all.

378
20:21.440 --> 20:23.360
You are busy with so many affairs every day,

379
20:23.360 --> 20:25.710
yet you still thought of having a chat with me.

380
20:25.710 --> 20:27.190
I'm the one bothering you.

381
20:28.190 --> 20:28.840
Brother.

382
20:28.840 --> 20:29.880
Please have a seat.

383
20:29.880 --> 20:30.710
Generalissimo, please.

384
20:30.710 --> 20:32.040
Please.

385
20:35.840 --> 20:36.470
Please.

386
20:41.080 --> 20:42.910
You are a frugal man,

387
20:43.120 --> 20:44.150
so today,

388
20:44.150 --> 20:45.990
I invited a chef from Shanxi

389
20:46.320 --> 20:47.340
to specially make a few

390
20:47.340 --> 20:48.860
Shanxi specialty dishes

391
20:49.040 --> 20:50.430
to welcome you.

392
20:52.260 --> 20:55.260
You really put a lot of thought into this.

393
20:55.430 --> 20:56.910
Thank you, Generalissimo.

394
20:56.910 --> 20:58.150
As for me,

395
20:58.320 --> 20:59.850
I don't have much ambition.

396
21:00.030 --> 21:01.230
I just love my home

397
21:01.470 --> 21:02.840
and have a big appetite.

398
21:02.860 --> 21:05.030
I might not necessarily like

399
21:05.190 --> 21:06.650
the delicacies out there.

400
21:06.760 --> 21:09.440
But if I don't eat these Shanxi dishes for a day,

401
21:09.800 --> 21:11.530
I feel uncomfortable all over.

402
21:11.630 --> 21:12.430
In that case,

403
21:12.430 --> 21:13.360
you and I

404
21:13.520 --> 21:15.910
really share the same interests.

405
21:16.110 --> 21:17.710
I am exactly the same.

406
21:17.990 --> 21:20.320
It's just that in my current position,

407
21:20.840 --> 21:22.560
sometimes I have no choice.

408
21:23.470 --> 21:25.710
You carry a heavy responsibility,

409
21:25.760 --> 21:27.610
worrying about the whole country.

410
21:27.610 --> 21:29.480
I can't compare to you.

411
21:29.510 --> 21:30.840
You're too polite.

412
21:30.990 --> 21:32.030
Muyin (Qian Dajun).

413
21:32.030 --> 21:32.630
Here.

414
21:32.630 --> 21:33.830
Is everything ready?

415
21:33.990 --> 21:35.360
It's ready, Generalissimo.

416
21:35.360 --> 21:36.520
Brother, please come over

417
21:36.520 --> 21:37.450
and have a taste.

418
21:37.520 --> 21:38.150
Generalissimo, please.

419
21:38.150 --> 21:38.760
Please.

420
21:48.470 --> 21:50.170
Brother, have some more.

421
21:51.040 --> 21:52.800
I'm full.

422
21:52.970 --> 21:53.880
Generalissimo,

423
21:53.880 --> 21:56.600
these Shanxi dishes made by the chef

424
21:56.800 --> 21:59.600
are even more authentic than what I eat in Taiyuan.

425
21:59.990 --> 22:02.990
Thank you for your warm hospitality.

426
22:03.070 --> 22:04.670
This is the fullest I've been

427
22:04.670 --> 22:06.670
since I came to Nanjing.

428
22:07.040 --> 22:07.770
That's good.

429
22:08.520 --> 22:11.190
Since you came from North China this time,

430
22:11.600 --> 22:14.030
I have something to ask you.

431
22:14.580 --> 22:17.780
What do you think of the current situation in North China?

432
22:17.990 --> 22:20.120
Please rest assured, Generalissimo.

433
22:20.190 --> 22:23.120
Ever since I decided to follow you,

434
22:23.320 --> 22:25.190
I have made up my mind

435
22:25.360 --> 22:26.800
to stand with you

436
22:27.010 --> 22:29.190
and face the national crisis together.

437
22:29.190 --> 22:32.760
If you choose to preserve the nation's territory

438
22:33.150 --> 22:34.550
and endure humiliation,

439
22:35.190 --> 22:38.710
then I will share the burden with you.

440
22:38.960 --> 22:39.690
If you

441
22:39.710 --> 22:41.670
choose to rouse the national spirit

442
22:41.670 --> 22:43.080
and fight the enemy,

443
22:43.390 --> 22:46.600
then I am willing to be your vanguard,

444
22:46.710 --> 22:49.630
brave any danger for you, without hesitation.

445
22:51.320 --> 22:52.280
Good.

446
22:52.630 --> 22:54.840
In these times of internal strife and foreign threats,

447
22:54.840 --> 22:57.710
having a capable general like you

448
22:57.760 --> 23:00.020
is truly a great fortune for the country.

449
23:05.630 --> 23:07.040
Regarding North China,

450
23:08.200 --> 23:10.690
what do you plan to do?

451
23:11.960 --> 23:12.760
Regarding North China,

452
23:12.760 --> 23:14.560
the Japanese have become unscrupulous

453
23:14.560 --> 23:15.560
and aggressive.

454
23:15.840 --> 23:18.440
We cannot rashly send troops to confront them.

455
23:18.990 --> 23:20.470
As you know, some time ago,

456
23:20.470 --> 23:21.730
the government abolished

457
23:21.730 --> 23:23.710
the Peiping Branch of the Military Affairs Commission,

458
23:23.710 --> 23:25.060
as well as the Executive Yuan's

459
23:25.060 --> 23:27.910
Peiping Political Affairs Readjustment Commission.

460
23:27.910 --> 23:29.360
We plan to establish

461
23:29.470 --> 23:32.670
a Hebei-Chahar Political Affairs Commission this month

462
23:33.320 --> 23:35.560
to govern the political affairs of Hebei,

463
23:35.560 --> 23:36.600
Chahar,

464
23:36.760 --> 23:38.910
as well as Peiping and Tianjin.

465
23:40.080 --> 23:40.910
Of course,

466
23:41.040 --> 23:42.840
this Hebei-Chahar Political Affairs Commission

467
23:42.840 --> 23:46.240
will be subordinate to the Nanjing Nationalist Government.

468
23:49.190 --> 23:50.200
That's good.

469
23:51.120 --> 23:52.800
First, keep the Japanese at bay.

470
23:52.800 --> 23:55.060
Then we can negotiate things gradually.

471
23:56.080 --> 23:57.080
Brother,

472
23:57.630 --> 23:59.690
of the five provinces in North China,

473
23:59.910 --> 24:01.360
Shanxi is the key.

474
24:01.670 --> 24:03.280
With you in charge there, brother,

475
24:03.280 --> 24:04.540
I can rest easy.

476
24:08.430 --> 24:09.120
Of course,

477
24:09.320 --> 24:12.050
I also plan to entrust some affairs in North China

478
24:12.280 --> 24:13.760
to you.

479
24:14.150 --> 24:16.390
You should do more for the country

480
24:16.950 --> 24:18.410
and share its burdens.

481
24:20.120 --> 24:22.520
If you need me,

482
24:22.560 --> 24:23.820
I'll do whatever I can.

483
24:24.670 --> 24:25.430
Brother.

484
24:26.040 --> 24:27.560
Please sit.

485
24:27.800 --> 24:28.910
Please sit.

486
24:30.040 --> 24:31.080
Brother.

487
24:31.150 --> 24:32.840
For me right now,

488
24:34.520 --> 24:36.980
it is the Communist Army in northern Shaanxi

489
24:37.390 --> 24:38.590
that makes me uneasy.

490
24:38.670 --> 24:40.430
I think you must have

491
24:40.590 --> 24:42.520
a profound understanding of this,

492
24:42.630 --> 24:44.760
because the Communist Army and Shanxi

493
24:44.880 --> 24:46.910
are only separated by the Yellow River.

494
24:46.910 --> 24:48.630
Rest assured, Generalissimo.

495
24:48.630 --> 24:51.960
I've already drawn up a series of anti-Communist measures:

496
24:52.310 --> 24:54.310
ideological,

497
24:54.330 --> 24:56.050
public, political,

498
24:56.290 --> 24:57.310
and military.

499
24:57.680 --> 24:59.420
Combined with your principles of

500
24:59.420 --> 25:01.760
"act vigorously, quickly, and firmly" ,

501
25:02.380 --> 25:04.640
they won't just stop the Communist Army.

502
25:05.080 --> 25:06.880
Not even the heavenly armies

503
25:07.150 --> 25:10.330
could set foot in Shanxi.

504
25:10.950 --> 25:11.880
Good.

505
25:12.430 --> 25:14.840
But you don't need to worry too much, brother.

506
25:14.840 --> 25:16.910
If the Communist Army dares to invade Shanxi,

507
25:16.910 --> 25:18.520
you just need to send a telegram,

508
25:18.520 --> 25:21.760
and the Central Army can reinforce Shanxi at any time.

509
25:23.560 --> 25:27.390
Then I am truly relieved.

510
25:30.190 --> 25:32.050
Generalissimo, the soup is here.

511
25:36.360 --> 25:37.240
Director Yan.

512
25:37.910 --> 25:39.150
This Nanjing-style duck soup

513
25:39.150 --> 25:40.280
warms the stomach and wards off the cold.

514
25:40.280 --> 25:43.280
The Generalissimo had it specially prepared for you.

515
25:43.990 --> 25:45.520
I'm afraid I don't have room

516
25:45.990 --> 25:47.580
for any more soup.

517
25:49.230 --> 25:50.890
This Nanjing-style duck soup

518
25:51.610 --> 25:53.740
is a major specialty of this place.

519
25:54.150 --> 25:56.280
It is of great cultural significance.

520
25:56.430 --> 25:57.880
You really must try

521
25:58.950 --> 26:00.910
this old duck soup.

522
26:01.140 --> 26:02.120
Generalissimo,

523
26:02.190 --> 26:03.880
I really can't drink anymore.

524
26:04.210 --> 26:04.920
Brother.

525
26:44.080 --> 26:44.990
Adjutant Chen.

526
26:45.230 --> 26:45.910
Yes, sir.

527
26:46.120 --> 26:47.910
After arriving at the guild hall,

528
26:47.910 --> 26:50.550
get me a bowl of sliced noodles

529
26:51.150 --> 26:52.840
with extra vinegar.

530
26:53.130 --> 26:53.780
Yes.

531
27:04.280 --> 27:05.360
Generalissimo.

532
27:05.950 --> 27:07.360
This is Executive Yuan's

533
27:07.430 --> 27:09.600
Provisional Organization Outline of the Hebei-Chahar Political Affairs Council.

534
27:09.600 --> 27:10.660
Please take a look.

535
27:15.560 --> 27:17.430
I hope this grievance

536
27:18.280 --> 27:22.380
can buy more time for internal pacification.

537
27:23.560 --> 27:26.340
Okay, I know.

538
27:36.760 --> 27:39.500
[Peiping]

539
27:36.910 --> 27:38.120
Stop the civil war!

540
27:38.190 --> 27:39.560
Stop the civil war!

541
27:39.580 --> 27:40.760
Unite against foreign enemies!

542
27:40.760 --> 27:42.280
Unite against foreign enemies!

543
27:42.280 --> 27:43.710
Down with Japanese imperialism!

544
27:43.710 --> 27:45.320
Down with Japanese imperialism!

545
27:45.040 --> 27:46.740
[Peng Tao, Director of the Organization Department of the CPC Peiping Provisional Working Committee]

546
27:45.560 --> 27:46.910
Down with traitors!

547
27:46.930 --> 27:48.690
Down with traitors!

548
27:48.950 --> 27:49.840
Comrades!

549
27:49.950 --> 27:50.950
Students!

550
27:51.120 --> 27:52.560
Since the loss of the four northeastern provinces,

551
27:52.560 --> 27:53.960
North China is in danger!

552
27:54.190 --> 27:55.840
Faced with the threat of national annihilation,

553
27:55.840 --> 27:58.430
the Chinese people must not surrender!

554
27:58.670 --> 27:59.910
We must unite

555
27:59.930 --> 28:00.930
and join forces!

556
28:01.200 --> 28:02.470
Down with Japanese imperialism!

557
28:02.470 --> 28:04.280
Down with Japanese imperialism!

558
28:04.280 --> 28:05.600
Oppose North China autonomy!

559
28:05.600 --> 28:07.260
Oppose North China autonomy!

560
28:07.360 --> 28:08.690
As big as North China is,

561
28:09.320 --> 28:12.040
there is no place for a quiet desk!

562
28:12.430 --> 28:13.950
We must unite

563
28:13.950 --> 28:15.310
and appeal to the authorities

564
28:15.310 --> 28:17.800
to stop the civil war and unite against foreign enemies!

565
28:17.800 --> 28:20.080
North China belongs to the Chinese people,

566
28:20.080 --> 28:21.670
and cannot be sold out by traitors!

567
28:21.670 --> 28:23.640
Down with Japanese imperialism!

568
28:23.660 --> 28:25.900
The Nationalist government's continued concessions

569
28:25.000 --> 28:26.480
[Guo Mingqiu, Chairman of the Peiping Students' Union]

570
28:26.190 --> 28:27.190
to Japan sparked

571
28:27.190 --> 28:29.430
widespread public outrage.

572
28:29.910 --> 28:31.040
Losing territory and sovereignty,

573
28:31.040 --> 28:33.430
and facing the threat of national subjugation and annihilation,

574
28:33.430 --> 28:36.150
calls for resistance against Japan grew louder across the country.

575
28:36.150 --> 28:38.470
On December 9, 1935,

576
28:38.630 --> 28:40.710
under the leadership of the Communist Party of China's

577
28:40.710 --> 28:42.430
Peiping Provisional Working Committee,

578
28:42.430 --> 28:43.760
composed of Li Changqing, Peng Tao,

579
28:43.760 --> 28:45.950
Zhou Xiaozhou and others,

580
28:46.320 --> 28:49.080
and organized by Party members

581
28:49.270 --> 28:51.900
working among students such as Yao Yilin, Guo Mingqiu,

582
28:51.900 --> 28:53.830
Huang Jing and Song Li,

583
28:54.520 --> 28:56.630
thousands of patriotic students

584
28:56.630 --> 28:59.600
took to the streets of Peiping, chanting slogans such as

585
28:59.600 --> 29:01.910
"Stop the civil war," "Unite against foreign aggression,"

586
29:01.910 --> 29:04.110
and "Down with Japanese imperialism."

587
29:04.220 --> 29:06.150
They held a massive demonstration

588
29:06.150 --> 29:08.560
calling for resistance against Japan and national salvation,

589
29:08.560 --> 29:11.820
an event that came to be known as the December 9th Movement.

590
29:12.430 --> 29:13.670
Arise,

591
29:13.670 --> 29:16.600
all who refuse to be slaves.

592
29:16.600 --> 29:19.150
Let our flesh and blood build

593
29:19.150 --> 29:22.320
a new Great Wall.

594
29:22.320 --> 29:27.880
The Chinese nation faces its greatest peril,

595
29:27.880 --> 29:31.390
and each of us is driven to make our final stand.

596
29:30.410 --> 29:31.880
[Edgar Snow, American journalist and lecturer at Yenching University's School of Journalism]

597
29:31.390 --> 29:32.600
Dear, look.

598
29:31.910 --> 29:34.950
[Helen Foster Snow, American journalist and wife of Edgar Snow]

599
29:32.600 --> 29:33.880
China is awakening.

600
29:33.880 --> 29:36.150
Arise, arise.

601
29:36.150 --> 29:38.280
United as one,

602
29:38.280 --> 29:40.560
we march through the enemy's gunfire.

603
29:40.560 --> 29:42.760
Forward, forward.

604
29:42.760 --> 29:44.760
Forward.

605
29:44.790 --> 29:48.500
[Wayaobu, Shaanxi]

606
29:47.670 --> 29:48.250
Luofu.

607
29:49.040 --> 29:49.800
You called us in such a hurry.

608
29:49.800 --> 29:50.950
Is there any good news?

609
29:50.950 --> 29:52.360
Absolutely good news.

610
29:52.570 --> 29:54.230
These newspapers were brought back from enemy-occupied territory

611
29:54.230 --> 29:56.360
by our comrades working underground.

612
29:56.710 --> 29:57.670
On December 9th,

613
29:58.070 --> 29:59.970
our Peiping Provisional Working Committee

614
29:59.970 --> 30:00.680
successfully led

615
30:00.680 --> 30:03.520
the students' anti-Japanese national salvation demonstration.

616
30:03.520 --> 30:04.910
They opposed North China autonomy,

617
30:04.910 --> 30:07.040
unanimously calling for an end to the civil war

618
30:07.040 --> 30:08.320
and uniting to resist Japan.

619
30:08.320 --> 30:10.840
Now the demonstrations have spread to

620
30:10.910 --> 30:12.170
Guangzhou, Shanghai,

621
30:12.390 --> 30:14.430
Nanjing, Wuhan and other major cities

622
30:14.430 --> 30:15.390
with great momentum.

623
30:15.390 --> 30:16.450
The newspaper says

624
30:16.520 --> 30:18.320
the students' actions have been echoed by

625
30:18.320 --> 30:20.230
many well-known patriots across the country.

626
30:20.230 --> 30:22.760
Soong Ching-ling even specially mailed

627
30:22.800 --> 30:24.120
over a hundred yuan from Shanghai

628
30:24.120 --> 30:25.520
to the Peiping Students' Federation

629
30:25.520 --> 30:26.880
to publicly support

630
30:26.880 --> 30:28.430
the students' patriotic movement.

631
30:28.430 --> 30:30.950
Mr. Lu Xun also wrote an article specifically,

632
30:30.950 --> 30:33.150
quoting a famous saying by Zhang Dai of the Ming Dynasty;

633
30:33.150 --> 30:34.280
"Loyal ministers and righteous men

634
30:34.280 --> 30:36.510
often emerge when their country is on the brink of ruin,

635
30:36.510 --> 30:38.040
like sparks struck from stone,

636
30:38.040 --> 30:39.390
bright for an instant before they fade."

637
30:39.390 --> 30:40.250
In the article,

638
30:40.560 --> 30:42.080
Mr. Lu Xun specifically emphasized

639
30:42.080 --> 30:45.210
that as long as the stone remains, the spark will not die.

640
30:46.520 --> 30:47.880
This Chiang

641
30:48.150 --> 30:50.910
has been militarily encircling and suppressing us,

642
30:50.910 --> 30:53.230
but has never succeeded.

643
30:53.840 --> 30:55.280
His cultural encirclement and suppression

644
30:55.280 --> 30:57.410
has been broken by the students again.

645
30:58.190 --> 30:59.850
No wonder Comrade Zedong said

646
30:59.850 --> 31:02.050
young students are firewood.

647
31:02.080 --> 31:03.390
Everything is ready,

648
31:03.520 --> 31:05.200
just waiting for a spark.

649
31:05.840 --> 31:06.900
What is this spark?

650
31:07.080 --> 31:09.410
The spark is our Communist Party of China.

651
31:09.560 --> 31:10.040
Yes.

652
31:10.230 --> 31:12.800
If Chiang remains obstinate,

653
31:12.550 --> 31:15.730
[Kai Feng (He Kequan), Alternate Member of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee]

654
31:12.910 --> 31:14.390
once this fire catches,

655
31:14.470 --> 31:16.460
it will surely bring about his downfall.

656
31:16.460 --> 31:17.020
We will

657
31:17.080 --> 31:18.630
go draft a telegram right now

658
31:18.630 --> 31:19.670
to report this good news

659
31:19.670 --> 31:21.660
to Comrade Zedong and Comrade Enlai.

660
31:21.660 --> 31:22.600
-Let's go. -Okay.

661
31:22.600 --> 31:23.190
Let's go.

662
31:25.940 --> 31:29.270
[Xi'an Pacification Headquarters, Shaanxi]

663
31:29.310 --> 31:31.860
[Ministerial appointments have largely been settled]

664
31:34.660 --> 31:38.460
[Yang Hucheng, Director of the Xi'an Pacification Headquarters of the Nationalist Government]

665
31:41.360 --> 31:41.950
Come in.

666
31:43.080 --> 31:43.730
Director.

667
31:48.570 --> 31:49.810
A man claiming to be

668
31:49.840 --> 31:51.360
Wang Feng, a CPC representative,

669
31:51.230 --> 31:53.780
[Wang Juren, Confidential Secretary to Yang Hucheng]

670
31:51.470 --> 31:52.360
brought you

671
31:52.380 --> 31:54.510
a handwritten letter from Mao Zedong.

672
31:55.410 --> 31:57.410
A letter written to me by Mao Zedong?

673
32:05.950 --> 32:07.950
There are Blue Shirt Society agents

674
32:08.280 --> 32:10.360
all over Xi'an now.

675
32:11.710 --> 32:12.910
Don't let them deceive you.

676
32:12.910 --> 32:14.910
I've already had Wang Feng detained

677
32:14.910 --> 32:16.880
at the military justice office for the time being.

678
32:16.880 --> 32:19.010
You can decide based on the situation.

679
32:19.230 --> 32:20.040
Well done.

680
32:20.120 --> 32:21.360
Then this letter...

681
32:34.430 --> 32:36.280
To Mr. Huchen.

682
32:37.080 --> 32:38.210
Our nation now faces

683
32:38.470 --> 32:41.040
the imminent threat of subjugation and annihilation.

684
32:41.040 --> 32:44.360
All patriotic people and revolutionary soldiers

685
32:44.470 --> 32:46.670
should feel the deepest sorrow,

686
32:46.840 --> 32:47.990
rise up together,

687
32:48.230 --> 32:50.320
and fight against Japan and Chiang Kai-shek.

688
32:50.320 --> 32:52.120
Japanese imperialism

689
32:52.320 --> 32:54.390
is the mortal enemy of our nation,

690
32:54.910 --> 32:56.170
while Chiang Kai-shek

691
32:56.280 --> 32:58.600
is the public enemy of the whole country.

692
32:58.910 --> 33:00.840
Therefore, resisting Japan and opposing Chiang

693
33:00.840 --> 33:02.230
are equally important.

694
33:02.520 --> 33:04.800
We have raised the banner of righteousness across the country,

695
33:04.800 --> 33:07.000
calling for justice throughout China.

696
33:07.230 --> 33:08.800
We shall drive out the foreign aggressors.

697
33:08.800 --> 33:11.660
All 400 million Chinese stand united in this cause.

698
33:12.150 --> 33:13.840
The elimination of traitors and villains

699
33:13.840 --> 33:16.440
will be a triumph celebrated for generations.

700
33:16.990 --> 33:19.430
We are determined to defend our country,

701
33:19.950 --> 33:21.280
and we have taken up arms

702
33:21.470 --> 33:24.800
and marched 20,000 li. What else could have brought us here?

703
33:24.990 --> 33:26.850
Now that we have reached Shaanxi,

704
33:26.910 --> 33:28.510
we seek like-minded allies.

705
33:29.190 --> 33:31.120
If we could join forces with your army

706
33:31.120 --> 33:32.470
and advance together,

707
33:32.760 --> 33:35.800
our nation would be greatly strengthened.

708
33:36.280 --> 33:38.050
Our rear would be more secure,

709
33:38.360 --> 33:40.560
and our frontline would be reinforced.

710
33:40.560 --> 33:44.600
All those willing to join the united front against Japan and Chiang Kai-shek

711
33:44.600 --> 33:47.190
will find us ready to work with them.

712
33:47.630 --> 33:49.600
Together, we shall form an Anti-Japanese Allied Army

713
33:49.600 --> 33:51.950
and establish a National Defense Government

714
33:51.950 --> 33:54.560
to lead the campaign against Japan and Chiang Kai-shek.

715
33:54.560 --> 33:56.220
With heavily guarded passes,

716
33:56.310 --> 33:58.280
who says there is no one in the Qin fortress?

717
33:58.280 --> 33:59.800
Yet our vast homeland lies in ruins,

718
33:59.800 --> 34:02.630
and the lands of Yanyun in the north are in grave peril.

719
34:02.630 --> 34:04.320
The fate of a subjugated people

720
34:04.320 --> 34:05.850
is unacceptable to anyone.

721
34:06.360 --> 34:07.800
It is better to avoid

722
34:08.159 --> 34:09.420
the fate of a prisoner.

723
34:09.989 --> 34:11.449
In this freezing weather,

724
34:11.719 --> 34:13.239
I offer these few words.

725
34:13.820 --> 34:15.080
We are in the same boat,

726
34:15.679 --> 34:17.810
and I look forward to your wise advice.

727
34:25.840 --> 34:28.320
This doesn't sound like an exhausted army.

728
34:33.679 --> 34:36.139
Mao Zedong is not only a military commander,

729
34:36.719 --> 34:38.370
but also a scholar.

730
34:39.389 --> 34:41.199
What a powerful pen.

731
34:41.719 --> 34:42.409
Director,

732
34:43.159 --> 34:46.469
are you sure this was written by Mao Zedong himself?

733
34:46.639 --> 34:47.900
The Blue Shirt Society

734
34:48.469 --> 34:50.880
could never write with such spirit and conviction.

735
34:50.880 --> 34:53.449
Then how should we reply?

736
35:02.280 --> 35:04.080
Make sure to treat Mr. Wang well.

737
35:04.110 --> 35:04.690
Yes.

738
35:04.990 --> 35:05.590
Go.

739
35:20.110 --> 35:21.360
Stop the civil war!

740
35:21.720 --> 35:22.780
Stop the civil war!

741
35:23.240 --> 35:24.550
Unite against foreign enemies!

742
35:24.550 --> 35:26.110
Unite against foreign enemies!

743
35:26.110 --> 35:27.720
Down with the traitors!

744
35:27.720 --> 35:29.550
Down with the traitors!

745
35:29.550 --> 35:30.950
Recover the Northeast!

746
35:30.950 --> 35:32.350
Recover the Northeast!

747
35:32.470 --> 35:33.750
Stop the civil war!

748
35:33.910 --> 35:35.360
Stop the civil war!

749
35:35.390 --> 35:36.720
Unite against foreign enemies!

750
35:36.720 --> 35:38.200
Unite against foreign enemies!

751
35:38.200 --> 35:39.550
Down with the traitors!

752
35:39.640 --> 35:41.070
Down with the traitors!

753
35:41.090 --> 35:42.450
Recover the Northeast!

754
35:42.720 --> 35:44.190
Recover the Northeast!

755
35:44.470 --> 35:47.360
I heard it was organized and led by the Communist Party.

756
35:47.360 --> 35:49.470
Major cities across the country are in an uproar.

757
35:49.470 --> 35:52.270
The Communist Party really wants to resist Japan.

758
35:52.390 --> 35:53.820
Stop the civil war!

759
35:53.980 --> 35:55.120
Unite against foreign enemies!

760
35:55.120 --> 35:56.590
Unite against foreign enemies!

761
35:56.590 --> 35:58.590
Down with the traitors!

762
35:58.590 --> 36:00.640
Down with the traitors!

763
36:01.030 --> 36:02.240
Where are we going to see Mr. Du?

764
36:02.240 --> 36:03.360
Recover the Northeast!

765
36:03.360 --> 36:04.430
I just got the news.

766
36:04.720 --> 36:06.880
Mr. Du has been granted medical parole.

767
36:06.880 --> 36:09.140
Let's go straight to his house to see him.

768
36:10.680 --> 36:11.240
Let's go.

769
36:13.910 --> 36:16.030
Down with the traitors!

770
36:16.030 --> 36:18.040
Down with the traitors!

771
36:18.070 --> 36:19.550
Recover the Northeast!

772
36:19.550 --> 36:20.880
Recover the Northeast!

773
36:20.880 --> 36:22.030
Stop the civil war!

774
36:22.030 --> 36:23.480
Stop the civil war!

775
36:23.510 --> 36:24.880
Unite against foreign enemies!

776
36:24.880 --> 36:26.280
Unite against foreign enemies!

777
36:26.280 --> 36:28.280
People of the whole country, unite!

778
36:28.280 --> 36:30.280
People of the whole country, unite!

779
36:30.350 --> 36:32.110
Down with the traitors!

780
36:32.110 --> 36:34.760
Down with the traitors!

781
36:34.910 --> 36:36.390
Recover the Northeast!

782
36:36.390 --> 36:37.840
Recover the Northeast!

783
36:37.840 --> 36:39.320
Stop the civil war!

784
36:39.320 --> 36:40.550
Stop the civil war!

785
36:40.760 --> 36:42.070
Unite against foreign enemies!

786
36:42.070 --> 36:43.990
Unite against foreign enemies!

787
36:43.990 --> 36:45.640
Down with the traitors!

788
36:45.640 --> 36:47.800
Down with the traitors!

789
36:48.550 --> 36:49.760
Come in.

790
36:50.320 --> 36:51.240
Hanqing.

791
36:51.370 --> 36:52.110
Are you alone?

792
36:52.110 --> 36:52.650
Yes.

793
36:53.470 --> 36:54.270
Hang it there.

794
36:54.280 --> 36:54.800
Come.

795
36:56.390 --> 36:58.250
You dare to come to me at this time.

796
36:58.280 --> 36:59.800
You are quite bold.

797
37:00.110 --> 37:01.510
I'm not afraid.

798
37:01.800 --> 37:04.070
Zhongyuan, you've suffered in prison.

799
37:04.680 --> 37:06.070
I brought you a wild ginseng

800
37:06.070 --> 37:08.200
that the old Marshal treasured before

801
37:08.890 --> 37:10.040
to nourish your body.

802
37:09.760 --> 37:12.890
[Du Zhongyuan, Chief Distributor of New Life Weekly, patriotic activist]

803
37:10.470 --> 37:12.160
Thank you for your concern, Hanqing.

804
37:12.160 --> 37:12.660
Sit.

805
37:12.800 --> 37:13.470
Sit.

806
37:15.760 --> 37:18.360
What I suffered was just physical pain.

807
37:18.510 --> 37:19.510
It's nothing to mention.

808
37:19.510 --> 37:22.070
Your suffering is not merely physical.

809
37:22.200 --> 37:23.680
The anguish you bear must be far greater than mine.

810
37:23.680 --> 37:25.030
What do you mean by that?

811
37:25.800 --> 37:26.840
Look at you.

812
37:27.070 --> 37:28.320
Your eyes are red.

813
37:28.760 --> 37:30.890
You cried before you came, didn't you?

814
37:41.240 --> 37:42.360
To be honest,

815
37:42.550 --> 37:43.840
on my way here,

816
37:44.760 --> 37:47.360
I saw students protesting against Japan.

817
37:48.070 --> 37:49.280
Every word they said

818
37:49.680 --> 37:52.470
stabbed my heart like a knife.

819
37:55.390 --> 37:57.450
Defending our country against Japan

820
37:59.260 --> 38:01.100
has always been my deepest wish.

821
38:02.640 --> 38:04.540
The label of traitor to the nation

822
38:07.320 --> 38:08.520
weighs heavily on me.

823
38:08.760 --> 38:10.470
Since the September 18th Incident,

824
38:10.470 --> 38:14.070
the Japanese flag has spread from the Northeast to North China.

825
38:14.680 --> 38:15.910
Every time I see it,

826
38:16.450 --> 38:18.300
my eyes burn

827
38:19.360 --> 38:20.770
and my heart aches.

828
38:21.590 --> 38:23.840
I still remember

829
38:24.160 --> 38:26.540
when you learned of the Marshal's death.

830
38:27.030 --> 38:29.230
You pretended to be calm on the surface.

831
38:29.330 --> 38:31.440
But the way you held his body

832
38:31.470 --> 38:33.120
and cried bitterly

833
38:33.640 --> 38:35.040
is still vivid in my mind.

834
38:35.640 --> 38:36.760
I know

835
38:37.110 --> 38:40.510
this national humiliation and personal grief have been eating away at you.

836
38:40.510 --> 38:42.590
You took such a big risk to see me.

837
38:43.070 --> 38:45.600
You must have a great confusion in your heart.

838
38:48.760 --> 38:49.590
Brother.

839
38:49.760 --> 38:51.880
Then I'll get straight to the point.

840
38:52.110 --> 38:55.640
You proposed the joint anti-Japanese effort in the Northwest.

841
38:56.200 --> 38:58.430
I want to hear your insightful views.

842
38:58.590 --> 38:59.360
Hanqing.

843
38:59.430 --> 39:01.490
What concerns do you still have about

844
39:01.550 --> 39:03.510
forming a united front in the Northwest to resist Japan?

845
39:03.510 --> 39:04.760
About uniting with other factions,

846
39:04.760 --> 39:05.910
I have no concerns.

847
39:06.160 --> 39:07.590
But when it comes to uniting with the Red Army,

848
39:07.590 --> 39:09.390
I do have significant concerns.

849
39:09.640 --> 39:10.430
As you know,

850
39:10.550 --> 39:12.840
we are still fighting in northern Shaanxi,

851
39:12.840 --> 39:14.440
and I've lost two divisions.

852
39:14.470 --> 39:15.360
Hanqing.

853
39:15.470 --> 39:16.640
I actually think

854
39:17.030 --> 39:18.640
the one you should be least concerned about

855
39:18.640 --> 39:19.970
is the Communist Party.

856
39:21.720 --> 39:22.470
Why?

857
39:22.680 --> 39:24.360
I know that in Europe,

858
39:24.390 --> 39:26.720
you came into contact with fascist ideas.

859
39:27.000 --> 39:29.680
After returning, you relied heavily on Chiang Kai-shek,

860
39:29.680 --> 39:31.470
believing that China needs

861
39:31.470 --> 39:33.720
an authoritarian figure like him.

862
39:34.200 --> 39:35.360
But I think

863
39:36.160 --> 39:39.510
Chiang might not be reliable.

864
39:39.640 --> 39:41.240
The Northeast has been lost for four years.

865
39:41.240 --> 39:42.360
What has he done?

866
39:42.550 --> 39:45.080
And those warlords who claim to resist Japan,

867
39:45.430 --> 39:46.950
what have they done?

868
39:48.470 --> 39:50.840
They are just using it as a cover

869
39:50.990 --> 39:52.900
to seek their own interests.

870
39:53.430 --> 39:54.260
Did you know?

871
39:55.070 --> 39:57.520
On the fourth day after the September 18th Incident,

872
39:57.520 --> 39:59.730
the Communist Party of China published

873
39:59.760 --> 40:01.350
the Resolution on the Incident of Japanese Imperialism

874
40:01.350 --> 40:03.230
Forcibly Occupying Manchuria,

875
40:03.360 --> 40:05.800
putting forward their anti-Japanese stance.

876
40:05.800 --> 40:06.800
In April of the following year,

877
40:06.800 --> 40:08.360
they issued another declaration,

878
40:08.360 --> 40:09.950
officially declaring war on Japan.

879
40:09.950 --> 40:11.280
Only the Communist Party

880
40:11.280 --> 40:13.510
can truly implement the resistance against Japan.

881
40:13.510 --> 40:14.880
With such an army,

882
40:14.950 --> 40:16.840
what is there to worry about?

883
40:20.430 --> 40:22.160
You make a good point, brother.

884
40:22.640 --> 40:23.950
In recent years,

885
40:25.750 --> 40:28.420
I have learned many lessons.

886
40:31.240 --> 40:33.110
Especially over the past year,

887
40:35.430 --> 40:37.430
I've made one mistake after another

888
40:37.840 --> 40:39.510
because of my misguided views.

889
40:39.510 --> 40:40.320
Hanqing.

890
40:40.430 --> 40:41.720
Since you came to me,

891
40:41.950 --> 40:43.550
you must trust my character.

892
40:43.990 --> 40:45.390
My lifelong belief

893
40:45.680 --> 40:47.340
is solely to save the country.

894
40:47.550 --> 40:48.360
I believe

895
40:48.510 --> 40:50.110
that looking at China today,

896
40:50.110 --> 40:51.640
the only one capable of leading the Chinese people

897
40:51.640 --> 40:53.280
to resist Japanese aggression

898
40:53.280 --> 40:54.610
is the Communist Party.

899
40:54.760 --> 40:56.950
The only one that can save the Chinese nation from misery

900
40:56.950 --> 40:59.110
is also the Communist Party.

901
41:00.110 --> 41:02.040
Have you been in contact with them?

902
41:02.910 --> 41:03.950
Yes.

903
41:04.200 --> 41:06.400
In late November 1931,

904
41:06.430 --> 41:10.110
I had the honor of meeting Mr. Zhou Enlai.

905
41:10.320 --> 41:11.800
He expressed to me

906
41:12.110 --> 41:15.510
the Communist Party of China's stance on uniting to resist Japan.

907
41:15.510 --> 41:16.840
Years later,

908
41:17.070 --> 41:18.680
my memory is still fresh.

909
41:21.320 --> 41:22.240
Hanqing.

910
41:22.840 --> 41:24.510
If you think I, Du Zhongyuan,

911
41:24.680 --> 41:26.540
am an open and aboveboard person,

912
41:26.590 --> 41:27.800
then let me tell you this:

913
41:27.800 --> 41:28.800
Mr. Zhou Enlai

914
41:29.110 --> 41:30.840
and the communists he represents

915
41:30.840 --> 41:32.110
are just like us.

916
41:32.350 --> 41:34.070
They too are

917
41:34.270 --> 41:35.680
deeply patriotic people,

918
41:35.680 --> 41:37.640
men of integrity who are willing to risk their lives

919
41:37.640 --> 41:40.080
for their country and their people.

920
41:40.590 --> 41:42.050
Dealing with such people,

921
41:42.200 --> 41:44.000
what concerns do you still have?

922
41:44.640 --> 41:46.200
Let me show you something more recent.

923
41:46.200 --> 41:47.240
This is a declaration

924
41:47.240 --> 41:48.950
published by the Communist Party of China

925
41:48.950 --> 41:50.390
in the French newspaper La Nation

926
41:50.390 --> 41:51.320
on October 1.

927
41:51.590 --> 41:53.880
Since it bears the date August 1,

928
41:54.320 --> 41:56.390
it is also known as the August 1 Declaration.

929
41:56.390 --> 41:57.710
It clearly lays out

930
41:57.740 --> 41:59.170
the CPC's position on

931
41:59.390 --> 42:01.520
forming a united front against Japan.

932
42:01.550 --> 42:03.360
Chiang Kai-shek, Wang Jingwei,

933
42:03.360 --> 42:05.760
Zhang Xueliang and other traitors.

934
42:06.030 --> 42:07.510
Times have changed.

935
42:07.720 --> 42:08.880
Keep reading.

936
42:09.360 --> 42:11.070
Resist Japan and live,

937
42:11.070 --> 42:12.600
or refuse to resist and die.

938
42:12.680 --> 42:14.160
Resisting Japan and saving the country has become

939
42:14.160 --> 42:17.110
the sacred duty of every compatriot.

940
42:17.320 --> 42:18.380
Well said.

941
42:19.800 --> 42:22.390
The Soviet Government and the Communist Party

942
42:22.390 --> 42:24.720
hereby solemnly declare once again:

943
42:24.800 --> 42:27.280
As long as the KMT troops

944
42:27.470 --> 42:30.320
stop their attacks on the Soviet areas,

945
42:30.550 --> 42:34.170
and any forces take up arms against Japan,

946
42:34.320 --> 42:38.030
regardless of any old grudges between them and the Red Army

947
42:38.030 --> 42:39.880
in the past or present,

948
42:40.030 --> 42:42.510
regardless of any differences between them and the Red Army

949
42:42.510 --> 42:45.550
on internal issues,

950
42:45.680 --> 42:47.810
the Red Army will not only immediately

951
42:47.820 --> 42:49.430
cease hostilities against them,

952
42:49.430 --> 42:52.540
but is also willing to work closely with them

953
42:52.910 --> 42:54.570
to save the country together.

954
42:56.030 --> 42:56.990
Hanqing,

955
42:57.340 --> 43:00.160
history doesn't leave us many chances to choose.

956
43:00.430 --> 43:02.030
You have already missed one.

957
43:02.430 --> 43:03.830
Are you going to miss a second time?
